        <a href="https://www.britannica.com/biography/Hugh-Glass" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Encyclopaedia Britannica: Hugh Glass</a>
        <a href="https://www.newyorker.com/podcast/critics-at-large/what-survival-stories-tell-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Critics at Large: What Survival Stories Tell Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="shell footer"><span>THE LONG WAY BACK · AN ORIGINAL INTERACTIVE LEARNING EXPERIENCE</span><span>Vocabulary from the Critics at Large survival-stories materials</span></div>
